            <head n="1" source="#source-411454-411566"><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-411475-411506"><seg source="#source-411475-411477">13</seg></hi><seg source="#source-411506-411521">　小カール</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-411521-411536"><rb>島</rb><rt>とう</rt></ruby></head>
